{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Now this morning, for the third time, out to the Esterházy Collection; treasures to be admired without end! — one really cannot get enough of them. — The finest pieces are in the Prince’s private room, a garden room in the pavilion — next to the castle, where the great gallery is; the Prince was in this room and, as he heard me walking around, he asked who it was? — since it was not one of the public days; — he was pleased to hear that it was a Berlin professor who had already come for the third time and ordered the valet to show me everything, and as he soon drove off, I was also able to see the magnificent pieces of the cabinet once more — what a living room! — This Prince can travel a few miles from Vienna on his own land and property right up to the Turkish border. — Stayed there from 9 to 11 o’clock, — then — half an hour to go home, — changed clothes — to the Antiquities Cabinet, whose director, Prof. Sonnleitner, had invited me — he is unmarried — to lunch with him at an inn with a professor from Padua — a very learned and amiable man. We scholars are immediately much more at home with one another than with bankers, for example. — Then some walks in the city, — finally also to the Italian Opera and, as I had so much wished, Corradino il cuor di ferro, — which was melted and softened by the charming Dardanelli; — how sweetly she sang — and how David sang again with her! I did not contradict a man with whom I had entered into conversation at dinner last evening, who even went so far as to claim that Rossini’s music is music for the heart."}}],"created":1795080366,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":368,"prompt_tokens":484,"total_tokens":852,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-vWRF31jutkpEcX4RDrRRMQhQwQIjVyU9","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":484,"prompt_ms":551.961,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.1404152892561983,"prompt_per_second":876.8735472252569,"predicted_n":368,"predicted_ms":8744.832,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.827880108991828,"predicted_per_second":41.967644432734666}}